{"meta":{"id":"logging","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"로그","subtitle":"(저장 위치·시간·등급)","summary":"로그 저장 위치, 타임스탬프, 5단계 등급 규칙","tags":["aide","규칙","로그"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-install","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 border border-indigo-200/50 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>\n      1-rules\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Common Rules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    로그 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-indigo-400 font-serif\">(저장 위치·시간·등급)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/50 border border-indigo-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 로그 파일 저장 위치, 시간 설정, 등급 규칙\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">저장 위치 & 시간 설정</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">프로젝트 루트에 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">logs/</code>를 두고 코드와 분리, gitignore 대상</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">서비스가 여러 개면(중규모 이상) 서비스별 하위 폴더로 분리 (예: <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">logs/app/</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">logs/data_server/</code>)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">파일명에 날짜를 포함해 롤링 (예: <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">app_2026-07-17.log</code>)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">모든 로그 라인은 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">ISO 8601</strong>(YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS) 타임스탬프로 시작, 타임존 명시</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">로그 등급 (5단계)</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">.env의 LOG_LEVEL로 지정</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[26%]\">등급</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[74%]\">의미</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">DEBUG</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">개발 중에만 필요한 상세 정보. 운영에서는 기본 비활성화</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">INFO</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">정상 동작 중 알아둘 만한 이벤트(서버 시작, 요청 처리 완료 등)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">WARNING</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">에러는 아니지만 주의 필요(재시도 발생, deprecated 사용 등)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">ERROR</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">처리에 실패했지만 서비스는 계속 동작 가능</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">CRITICAL</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">서비스 자체가 멈출 수 있는 심각한 상황</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">도메인별 분리 & 함께 지킬 것</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">도메인이 여러 개면 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">LOG_LEVEL_&lt;도메인명&gt;</code>을 전역 LOG_LEVEL의 fallback으로 둔다 (예: LOG_LEVEL_AUTH=DEBUG)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">등급별로 어디에 남길지 정한다 (예: WARNING 이상만 파일 영구 저장, DEBUG는 콘솔만)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">에러 로그는 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">4-error</code>의 5필드(발생일/관련영역/문제요약/해결방안/향후주의사항) 양식으로 옮길 수 있게 스택트레이스·요청ID·원인을 포함</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Common Rules</span>\n  <span>로그</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/common-rules/logging","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}